706
00:52:29,520 --> 00:52:30,320
B.S...

707
00:52:30,380 --> 00:52:31,336
- Brothers!
- Brothers!

708
00:52:31,360 --> 00:52:32,050
B.S...

709
00:52:32,080 --> 00:52:32,946
- Brothers!
- Brothers!

710
00:52:32,970 --> 00:52:33,650
B.S...

711
00:52:33,680 --> 00:52:34,526
- Brothers!
- Brothers!

712
00:52:34,550 --> 00:52:35,136
B.S...

713
00:52:35,160 --> 00:52:36,160
- Brothers!
- Brothers!

714
00:52:39,090 --> 00:52:40,290
Let's go!

715
00:52:40,790 --> 00:52:41,790
Let's go!

716
